# In tokio tests that spawn an axum/hyper server (preference)

Standing user preference: In tokio tests that spawn an axum/hyper server, be aware that externally sent requests (e.g. curl or script POSTs) will silently time out if the spawned server task is never polled; use a proper async test harness that ensures the server task actually runs.

## Conventions
- In tokio tests that spawn an axum/hyper server, be aware that externally sent requests (e.g. curl or script POSTs) will silently time out if the spawned server task is never polled; use a proper async test harness that ensures the server task actually runs.

